"This PC's NVIDIA graphics chip is older than the RTX 20 series, so Monet uses the built-in graphics. Games run best in Windows."
msgstr ""
"Denne PC-ens NVIDIA-grafikkbrikke er eldre enn RTX 20-serien, så Monet bruker den innebygde grafikken. Spill kjører best i Windows."

