#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:248 crates/monet/src/main.rs:339
msgid ""
"Windows isn't installed yet. Choose Windows in the app menu to finish setting it up."
msgstr ""
"Windows er ikke installert ennå. Velg Windows i appmenyen for å fullføre oppsettet."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:250
msgid ""
"Windows is encrypted with BitLocker. Type its recovery key in Settings › Games & Controllers, and Monet opens it and sets it up."
msgstr ""
"Windows er kryptert med BitLocker. Skriv gjenopprettingsnøkkelen i Innstillinger › Spill & kontrollere, så åpner Monet den og gjør den klar."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:255
msgid ""
"Windows is asleep, so Monet can't set it up yet. Open Windows, choose Restart, and Monet finishes the rest."
msgstr ""
"Windows er i dvale, så Monet kan ikke gjøre oppsettet ennå. Åpne Windows, velg Start på nytt, så fullfører Monet resten."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:263
msgid "This PC didn't start in UEFI mode, so Monet can't switch to Windows."
msgstr ""
"Denne PC-en startet ikke i UEFI-modus, så Monet kan ikke bytte til Windows."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:270 crates/monet/src/main.rs:593
msgid ""
"Windows wasn't found on this PC. Install Windows first, then try again."
msgstr ""
"Fant ikke Windows på denne PC-en. Installer Windows først, og prøv igjen."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:290
msgid "Not found"
msgstr "Ikke funnet"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:292
msgid "Unavailable (not a UEFI system)"
msgstr "Utilgjengelig (ikke et UEFI-system)"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:351
msgid "Play %1 on Windows?"
msgstr "Spille %1 i Windows?"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:352
msgid "Open in Windows?"
msgstr "Åpne i Windows?"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:353
msgid "Play on Windows?"
msgstr "Spille i Windows?"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:359
msgid "Your PC will restart in Windows and open it. Open apps will close."
msgstr "PC-en starter på nytt i Windows og åpner den. Åpne apper lukkes."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:360
msgid ""
"Your PC will restart in Windows and start the game. When you quit, it comes back to Monet."
msgstr ""
"PC-en din starter på nytt i Windows og åpner spillet. Når du avslutter, kommer den tilbake til Monet."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:361
msgid ""
"Your PC will restart in Windows with your game launchers ready to sign in to. Open apps will close."
msgstr ""
"PC-en din starter på nytt i Windows med spillklientene klare for pålogging. Åpne apper lukkes."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:362
msgid ""
"Your PC will restart in Windows, update it and your games, and switch off when they're done. Open apps will close."
msgstr ""
"PC-en din starter på nytt i Windows, oppdaterer den og spillene dine og slår seg av når alt er ferdig. Åpne apper lukkes."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:363
msgid "Your PC will restart in Windows. Open apps will close."
msgstr "PC-en din starter på nytt i Windows. Åpne apper lukkes."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:365
msgid ""
"Save your work first. Unsaved changes and private tabs aren't captured. Downloads stop during the restart; check Store's Downloads when you return."
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:597
msgid ""
"Monet seems to have started from the Windows entry, which shouldn't happen."
msgstr ""
"Monet ser ut til å ha startet fra Windows-oppføringen, og det skal ikke skje."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:636
msgid ""
"This PC's firmware didn't keep the switch to Windows. Restart and choose Windows in the PC's boot menu."
msgstr ""
"Fastvaren i denne PC-en husket ikke byttet til Windows. Start på nytt, og velg Windows i oppstartsmenyen til PC-en."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:667
msgid ""
"The restart was blocked. The switch to Windows was cancelled. Save your work and try again."
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:685
msgid ""
"Monet couldn't identify your desktop account. Start Windows from your desktop and try again."
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:691
msgid "Your desktop account could not be found. The switch was cancelled."
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:815
msgid "This copy of Monet can't install Windows by itself."
msgstr "Denne kopien av Monet kan ikke installere Windows selv."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:874
msgid ""
"Monet can install Windows from %1. Your PC restarts and Windows installs itself."
msgstr ""
"Monet kan installere Windows fra %1. PC-en din starter på nytt, og Windows installerer seg selv."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:877
msgid ""
"Windows isn't installed yet. Monet downloads it from Microsoft (about 7 GB) and installs it. This takes about 30 minutes."
msgstr ""
"Windows er ikke installert ennå. Monet laster det ned fra Microsoft (omtrent 7 GB) og installerer det. Dette tar omtrent 30 minutter."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:881
msgid "Set up Windows?"
msgstr "Sette opp Windows?"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:881
msgid "Set Up"
msgstr "Sett opp"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:885
msgid "Getting Windows ready for your games"
msgstr "Gjør Windows klar for spillene dine"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:890
msgid ""
"Monet is downloading Windows (about 7 GB). You can keep using your PC; Monet asks before it restarts."
msgstr ""
"Monet laster ned Windows (omtrent 7 GB). Du kan fortsette å bruke PC-en; Monet spør før PC-en starter på nytt."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:920
msgid ""
"Restart now to install Windows? It takes about 10 minutes, then you're back in Monet."
msgstr ""
"Starte på nytt nå for å installere Windows? Det tar omtrent 10 minutter, og så er du tilbake i Monet."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:930
msgid ""
"The restart was blocked. Save your work, then choose Restart and install in Play on Windows."
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:936
msgid "Windows setup stopped before it could use the installation media"
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:938
